# Guard rails and the rules every agent reads first. Code-owned paths are
# flagged by the labeler, receive extra reviewer scrutiny and a longer veto window,
# and require no human approval to merge.
#
# /tests/regressions/ is left unowned on purpose: agents add new regression
# files there freely; the `regressions-append-only` CI job keeps existing ones
# from being edited, renamed or deleted.

/fixtures/                @k7lim
/scripts/independent_*    @k7lim
conftest.py               @k7lim
pyproject.toml            @k7lim
/.github/                 @k7lim
/Makefile                 @k7lim
/AGENTS.md                @k7lim
/CLAUDE.md                @k7lim
/.factory/                @k7lim
